        }
        // ---- the tiles, selectable, and the selected one said in words --------
        //
        // Urs, 2026-09-10: the m/s/o lines "could be selectable and the
        // highlighted translated to human understandable line".
        //
        // A tile is five columns -- `k*80M` -- and five columns cannot say what
        // they mean. Every fact a sentence needs is already on the row the tile
        // was folded from: what it measures, in what unit, which door read it,
        // how it was witnessed, what state it is in, and the note its author
        // left. The tile is the compression; this is the row saying itself.
        //
